{"schemaVersion":1,"id":63,"sections":[{"id":"121004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[2140],"start":0,"count":22},{"id":"121004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[12130],"start":22,"count":31},{"id":"121005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[2150],"start":53,"count":32},{"id":"121005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[12140],"start":85,"count":28},{"id":"121006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[2160],"start":113,"count":34},{"id":"121006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[12150],"start":147,"count":27}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:1","scriptId":2140,"text":"情况有点不妙，因为丹妮丝没法靠近旗帜，而奥菲利亚她们正在步步逼近。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:2","scriptId":2140,"text":"“哦吼吼吼～这就是你的妙计吗？我看好像已经看到了结局啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:3","scriptId":2140,"text":"“恩，意料之外，原来把维卡藏起来不是为了狙击，而是为了不让我方靠近旗帜……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:4","scriptId":2140,"text":"“看来还是奥菲利亚更胜你一筹啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:5","scriptId":2140,"text":"“这样的胜负才有意思。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:6","scriptId":2140,"text":"看到我一脸镇定，伊莎贝尔觉得其中必有蹊跷。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:7","scriptId":2140,"text":"“哦？看你的架势，好像还有扭转局势的把握？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:8","scriptId":2140,"text":"我以行动来回应伊莎贝尔。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:9","scriptId":2140,"text":"“佛罗伦丝！葛瑞丝！看你们的了！进攻！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":764,"speaker":"佛罗伦丝·奥尼恩斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:10","scriptId":2140,"text":"“遵命！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":764,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":765,"speaker":"葛瑞丝·蒙哥马利","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:11","scriptId":2140,"text":"“终于等到攻击的命令了，快要等死我了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":764,"right":765,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:12","scriptId":2140,"text":"突然从奥菲利亚队伍的两侧袭来了炮火，形成了左右夹击之势。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":764,"right":765,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:14","scriptId":2140,"text":"“伏击吗！？这两个新人的行动速度很快啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:15","scriptId":2140,"text":"伏击的效果非常显著，因为是两侧的夹击，所以奥菲利亚也不能顶着这些炮火强行突破，所以行进速度大幅下降。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":593,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:16","scriptId":2140,"text":"“奥菲利亚队长，两侧的敌人就让我和姐姐去处理。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:17","scriptId":2140,"text":"“能行吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:18","scriptId":2140,"text":"“应该能行吧……不知道啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:19","scriptId":2140,"text":"“应该没问题，我这行动只是为了让队长能快点到达旗帜那里，只要拿到旗帜，基本就是我们赢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:20","scriptId":2140,"text":"“好的，那么尤拉殿后继续和维卡一起进行火力铺设。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:21","scriptId":2140,"text":"“Да！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:22","scriptId":2140,"text":"“好无聊的任务，只是一个劲射击就行了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-PROLOGUE:2140:23","scriptId":2140,"text":"佩妮和佐伊从阵型中脱出，分别向着两侧伏击的位置出发。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:1","scriptId":12130,"text":"由于佩妮和佐伊的进攻，葛瑞丝和佛罗伦丝的攻击目标不得不转向佩妮和佐伊，所以伏击算是被化解了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:2","scriptId":12130,"text":"奈特莉和奥菲利亚又可以继续向着旗帜前进，相对的丹妮丝还是没法靠近旗帜。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:3","scriptId":12130,"text":"“我这边的牵制攻击，对奥菲利亚她们没法奏效啊，为什么要我在丹妮丝的正后方待命啊！真是急死人了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:4","scriptId":12130,"text":"“可恶！这火力网太密了，不然我还是可以试试强行夺旗的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":259,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:5","scriptId":12130,"text":"虽然从现在的位置上看，还是丹妮丝更接近旗帜，但是因为她没法再更加靠近，所以其实已经进入了完全劣势。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":259,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:7","scriptId":12130,"text":"“哦呀，看来伏击只是奏效了一小段时间啊～根本无关痛痒嘛～你们已经输定了啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:8","scriptId":12130,"text":"“手牌还没出完前，请不要随便判断胜负。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:9","scriptId":12130,"text":"（确实，现在有点不妙啊，塞姬怎么还没到位啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:10","scriptId":12130,"text":"正当我自己也觉得局势可能已经有点控制不住的时候——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:11","scriptId":12130,"text":"向着的丹妮丝方向发射的炮火开始变得稀疏……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:12","scriptId":12130,"text":"“机会！丹妮丝，上！夺旗！不惜一切代价拿到旗帜。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":268,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:13","scriptId":12130,"text":"“不用你说，我也知道！这点火力我还是能突破的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:14","scriptId":12130,"text":"丹妮丝终于开始前进了，她一面闪避着飞来的炮弹，一面前进……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:15","scriptId":12130,"text":"…………………………………………………………","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:16","scriptId":12130,"text":"终于，丹妮丝率先触碰到了旗帜，并将其拔了起来！","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:17","scriptId":12130,"text":"“很好！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:18","scriptId":12130,"text":"拔起旗帜后，丹妮丝开始以最快速度撤离战场。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:19","scriptId":12130,"text":"“怎么会这样……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:20","scriptId":12130,"text":"奥菲利亚看了看尤拉的方向，并没有什么问题，尤拉仍旧在对丹妮丝进行狙击，虽然好像不容易命中的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:21","scriptId":12130,"text":"“那问题就出在……维卡？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:22","scriptId":12130,"text":"奥菲利亚回头看向了之前让维卡隐藏的地点——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:23","scriptId":12130,"text":"如奥菲利亚所想的一样……虽然听不太清炮火的声音，但是从烟雾来看，那里正在发生着战斗！","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:24","scriptId":12130,"text":"“维卡！？你那边发生了什么情况！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:25","scriptId":12130,"text":"“正在缠斗，无法进行火力支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:26","scriptId":12130,"text":"“……！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:27","scriptId":12130,"text":"“这难道是……塞姬！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:28","scriptId":12130,"text":"奥菲利亚终于反应过来，她在战场上始终没有见到塞姬，原来她是绕到了自己的后方对维卡进行妨碍攻击了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:29","scriptId":12130,"text":"“奈特莉停下！和我一起全力射击！！目标丹妮丝！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:30","scriptId":12130,"text":"“是！不过这个距离有点困难啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:31","scriptId":12130,"text":"（困难我当然知道……但是事到如今以我和奈特莉的速度，已经追不上丹妮丝了，只能转为攻击了！只要打中一发也好！）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121004-EPILOGUE:12130:32","scriptId":12130,"text":"奥菲利亚知道取胜的希望渺茫了……但她还是要挣扎一下……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:1","scriptId":2150,"text":"战局已经明朗化了，战局对奥菲利亚那边压倒性的不利……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":752,"right":572,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:2","scriptId":2150,"text":"“哟？有点本事嘛……刚才的伏击只是为了吸引佩妮和佐伊离开防守位置吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":572,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:3","scriptId":2150,"text":"“正是如此，因为塞姬比较聪明，最早开始的时候我就命令她找机会对付维卡。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:4","scriptId":2150,"text":"“塞姬……恩，她是挺机灵的，不过我倒是从没想过，让她这种小家伙深入敌后。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:5","scriptId":2150,"text":"“因为她神出鬼没的特性，让我觉得她可以胜任这个工作，虽然迟了点，不过看来还是完成得很漂亮～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:6","scriptId":2150,"text":"“和你之前所说的那些战术有点不太一样嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:7","scriptId":2150,"text":"“战术当然会有很多套备用方案咯～战场是活的～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":290,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:8","scriptId":2150,"text":"“……………………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":290,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":288,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:9","scriptId":2150,"text":"“说得不错…………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:10","scriptId":2150,"text":"伊莎贝尔很不情愿地从嘴里挤出了这几个字。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:11","scriptId":2150,"text":"战场上，奥菲利亚仍旧没有放弃的意思——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:12","scriptId":2150,"text":"“只要让丹妮丝停下就还有希望！不要放弃，继续进攻！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:13","scriptId":2150,"text":"话虽如此，但是奥菲利亚知道在这种情况下能拦下丹妮丝的希望渺茫。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:14","scriptId":2150,"text":"正当众人认为胜负已定的时候。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":264,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:15","scriptId":2150,"text":"“啊！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":264,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:16","scriptId":2150,"text":"丹妮丝左脚的履带被炮弹溅射出的碎片击断了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":264,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":0,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:17","scriptId":2150,"text":"“哼哼，看看，到最后还不是要靠我～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":0,"right":264,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:18","scriptId":2150,"text":"没想到竟然是尤拉在最后关头打中了至关重要的一炮。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":0,"right":264,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":754,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:19","scriptId":2150,"text":"“哦！干得好，尤拉！奈特莉跟着我，冲锋了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":0,"right":754,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:20","scriptId":2150,"text":"奥菲利亚开始全力追击正在紧急修理自己履带的丹妮丝。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":0,"right":754,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:22","scriptId":2150,"text":"“啊呀呀，好像在最后功亏一篑了呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:23","scriptId":2150,"text":"“恩，看起来是这样～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":284,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:24","scriptId":2150,"text":"“你竟然一点都不失落么？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":284,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:25","scriptId":2150,"text":"“那个……您是不是太专注于丹妮丝的行动上而忘了我这还有利薇尔这张牌？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":284,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:26","scriptId":2150,"text":"“不过我比较纳闷的是丹妮丝为什么没有第一时间把旗帜传给利薇尔……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":284,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":284,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:27","scriptId":2150,"text":"“……！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":284,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":288,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:28","scriptId":2150,"text":"“好吧，看来胜负已定……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:29","scriptId":2150,"text":"伊莎贝尔拿出信号弹，装入枪膛——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:30","scriptId":2150,"text":"“嘭！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:31","scriptId":2150,"text":"一道耀眼的光芒划过天空，这即是本次训练的终止符。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":759,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:32","scriptId":2150,"text":"“诶！？为什么结束了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":759,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-PROLOGUE:2150:33","scriptId":2150,"text":"虽然有点诧异，但是看到信号弹的双方都停下了战斗，开始向信号弹的发射点集合。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":759,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:1","scriptId":12140,"text":"很快，两队人马聚集到了伊莎贝尔所在的观众台上——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":759,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:2","scriptId":12140,"text":"奥菲利亚气冲冲的跑到伊莎贝尔跟前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":288,"right":759,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:3","scriptId":12140,"text":"“教官！为什么停止比赛！？明明已经有翻盘希望了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":759,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:4","scriptId":12140,"text":"“因为丹妮丝放水了啊……她并没有在第一时间把旗帜传递给在后面进行火力支援的利薇尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:5","scriptId":12140,"text":"伊莎贝尔扫了一眼站在一旁默不作声的丹妮丝。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":264,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:6","scriptId":12140,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":264,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:7","scriptId":12140,"text":"发现丹妮丝并没有否认放水的事情以后，奥菲利亚也就闭上了嘴，不过可以感觉得到她好像非常生气……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":264,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:8","scriptId":12140,"text":"“丹妮丝，我之后再找你算账……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":264,"right":761,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":264,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:9","scriptId":12140,"text":"“对不起……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":264,"right":761,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:10","scriptId":12140,"text":"“好了好了，这种样子的训练战斗也不是常有的事情，和自己的队长作战总是会有点抵触，我能理解。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":264,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:11","scriptId":12140,"text":"“虽然赢了，但是总觉得都是在长官的摆布之中，有点怪怪的感觉……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:12","scriptId":12140,"text":"“长官就是这个样子，特别喜欢卖关子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":746,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:13","scriptId":12140,"text":"“但是技战术正确，很好的利用了自己队员的能力，我还以为长官会采用速战速决的战术呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":746,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:14","scriptId":12140,"text":"“哈哈～让你失望了啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:15","scriptId":12140,"text":"“在战斗能力劣势的情况下凭借战术来击败对手，这才是指挥官应有的作用啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:16","scriptId":12140,"text":"“不要太夸他，过会儿肯定会得意忘形的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":746,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:17","scriptId":12140,"text":"“这次的作战，我想双方都大概了解对方的行为特性和桑赫斯特的地形了吧，那么明天就展开正式的对战训练了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":746,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:18","scriptId":12140,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":761,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:19","scriptId":12140,"text":"“恩，那么就这样，桑赫斯特的医务室在哪儿……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":761,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:20","scriptId":12140,"text":"“医务室？你要知道那里干什么？桑赫斯特的医务室可不是男性指挥官可以随便出入的地方。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:21","scriptId":12140,"text":"“那个……我有点肚子疼……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:22","scriptId":12140,"text":"“咦？长官还没恢复过来吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":581,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:23","scriptId":12140,"text":"“难道是脏器有受损吗？我之前就说应该先去看看的吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":581,"right":728,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:24","scriptId":12140,"text":"看到我额头两侧有些许渗出的虚汗，又看到其他队员关切的目光，伊莎贝尔叹了口说道——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":581,"right":728,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:25","scriptId":12140,"text":"“好吧……我这就带你们过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":581,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:26","scriptId":12140,"text":"“我很好奇，到底发生了什么事情？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":581,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":580,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:27","scriptId":12140,"text":"“就让我告诉您吧，不过现在比较赶时间，我们那边走边说～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":580,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121005-EPILOGUE:12140:28","scriptId":12140,"text":"就这样，伊莎贝尔带着我们去到了桑赫斯特的医务室……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":580,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:1","scriptId":2160,"text":"诊断结果是腹壁挫伤，存在微量软组织出血。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":580,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:2","scriptId":2160,"text":"“哦～～原来是这么回事啊～没想到你们的长官有那么‘辛苦’啊～”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:3","scriptId":2160,"text":"“当然啦～还有您不知道的呢……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":578,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:4","scriptId":2160,"text":"奈特莉和伊莎贝尔这两人像是一下子成为亲密的好友一般，在房间的一角说个没完……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":291,"right":578,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:6","scriptId":2160,"text":"经过了医师的专业治疗后，强制卧床休息的我正在被一群钢舞姬围观——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:7","scriptId":2160,"text":"“对不起，长官……没想到会弄成这样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:8","scriptId":2160,"text":"“我也没想到自己的身体那么不耐揍……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":728,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:9","scriptId":2160,"text":"“谁让长官平时不注重锻炼，军校毕业以后就没有再锻炼过了吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:10","scriptId":2160,"text":"“呃……无言以对……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":268,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:11","scriptId":2160,"text":"“所以说嘛，这脆弱的身躯就是你最大的弱点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:12","scriptId":2160,"text":"“只要后方保护好的话，我想应该没什么大问题吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":268,"right":752,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:13","scriptId":2160,"text":"“但是还要分派兵力保护，真是有点浪费啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":752,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":764,"speaker":"佛罗伦丝·奥尼恩斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:14","scriptId":2160,"text":"“我认为只要能带来胜利，那就有存在的意义。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":271,"right":764,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":765,"speaker":"葛瑞丝·蒙哥马利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:15","scriptId":2160,"text":"“是啊，旁观者清当局者迷这一点在本次的训练中就很好的反应出来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":765,"right":764,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":268,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:16","scriptId":2160,"text":"“葛瑞丝！说话注意点！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":765,"right":268,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":765,"speaker":"葛瑞丝·蒙哥马利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:17","scriptId":2160,"text":"“我只是说了事实而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":765,"right":268,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":280,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:18","scriptId":2160,"text":"“说不定是长官的那些队员放水才导致我们轻松获胜的呢！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":765,"right":280,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:19","scriptId":2160,"text":"“利薇尔，不要擅自作无端的推测！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":280,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":278,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:20","scriptId":2160,"text":"“是……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":278,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:21","scriptId":2160,"text":"场面变成了桑赫斯特队员互掐……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":761,"right":278,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:22","scriptId":2160,"text":"（唉……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":589,"right":278,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:23","scriptId":2160,"text":"佩妮看着昔日的队友也只能叹叹气，接着她朝向了躺在病床上的我。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":589,"right":278,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:24","scriptId":2160,"text":"“刚才已经进行了冷敷，小血肿也已经消退了。那么长官今天剩下的时间就在这里静养吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":278,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:25","scriptId":2160,"text":"“啊，谢谢了，那我就只能在这里躺着了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:26","scriptId":2160,"text":"“晚上再热敷一下应该就没什么问题了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":748,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:27","scriptId":2160,"text":"“晚饭会给你送来的啦～别担心饿肚子的问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":748,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:28","scriptId":2160,"text":"“那就有劳了，不知道桑赫斯特的伙食怎么样呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":748,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:29","scriptId":2160,"text":"“哼，我会给你送两个硬面包来的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":746,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:30","scriptId":2160,"text":"佐伊半开玩笑地说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":746,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:31","scriptId":2160,"text":"“不过这样的话，估计明天的正式训练比较悬啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:32","scriptId":2160,"text":"说话间，奈特莉好像已经和伊莎贝尔聊完了，她们两个已经来到了我的床边。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:33","scriptId":2160,"text":"“那就没办法了，让你们多留一天吧，不过报酬可不会追加的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":572,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:34","scriptId":2160,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-PROLOGUE:2160:35","scriptId":2160,"text":"听到这里，站在房间一角的维卡皱了皱眉头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:1","scriptId":12150,"text":"因为长官躺在医务室里，所以小队里剩下的成员也没什么特别的事情可以做。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":596,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:2","scriptId":12150,"text":"桑赫斯特的厨房——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":283,"right":596,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:3","scriptId":12150,"text":"“没想到姐姐还会想出这么有建设性的提议。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":596,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:4","scriptId":12150,"text":"“哼哼～我们把指挥官一个人留在医务室，自己先吃饭总不太好吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:5","scriptId":12150,"text":"“我倒是很久没有下厨做过菜了，不知道手艺退步了没有～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":740,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:6","scriptId":12150,"text":"因为桑赫斯特的食堂还没到开餐时间，来早了的众人本打算各自找地方消磨时间，结果佐伊提议大家一起给指挥官做晚餐。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":740,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:7","scriptId":12150,"text":"于是和伊莎贝尔商量后，暂时借用了桑赫斯特的厨房。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":740,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:8","scriptId":12150,"text":"“做菜我不太在行啊……我去问问伊莎贝尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":728,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:9","scriptId":12150,"text":"对于尤拉来说，做饭这种琐事反而比战斗还要更加困难……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":728,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:10","scriptId":12150,"text":"“维卡呢？倒是没有看到她嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":740,"right":728,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:11","scriptId":12150,"text":"“维卡的话，大概去桑赫斯特的后山弄食材去了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":748,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:12","scriptId":12150,"text":"“诶？这里不是已经有很多食材了吗？而且都是高级食材的说……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":748,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:13","scriptId":12150,"text":"“不清楚，维卡总有自己的打算吧，并不需要多管，只——姐姐！你的洋葱要焦了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":748,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":745,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:14","scriptId":12150,"text":"“啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":745,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:15","scriptId":12150,"text":"虽然佩妮即时提醒了佐伊，但是……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":745,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":743,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:16","scriptId":12150,"text":"“焦了啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":743,"right":584,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:17","scriptId":12150,"text":"“唉……好在还有时间，专心点做吧，姐姐……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":743,"right":589,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":743,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:18","scriptId":12150,"text":"“呜……好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":743,"right":589,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:19","scriptId":12150,"text":"“不要太浪费食物啊～不过佐伊你做杂煮的话，焦一点也没关系啦～我想长官也吃不出。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":743,"right":572,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:20","scriptId":12150,"text":"“也对～他这次赢了我们估计是非常得意吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":746,"right":572,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:21","scriptId":12150,"text":"“哼哼～小小的恶作剧我想长官是不会在意的～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":746,"right":578,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":742,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:22","scriptId":12150,"text":"“哼哼～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":742,"right":578,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:23","scriptId":12150,"text":"“你们正常点，浪费食物可不好！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":742,"right":591,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:24","scriptId":12150,"text":"“好啦好啦～我们开开玩笑的～佩妮不要当真啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":591,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":748,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:25","scriptId":12150,"text":"“诶！？原来是开玩笑的么……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":578,"right":748,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:26","scriptId":12150,"text":"“你看，姐姐就当真了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":589,"right":748,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"121006-EPILOGUE:12150:27","scriptId":12150,"text":"“好吧，认真做菜认真做菜～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":589,"right":574,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
